- `tests/test_focus.py:46` (`test_project_pin_includes_all_its_tasks`) and `:151` (`test_inbox_task_project_pin_is_no_op_and_notifies`)
- `tests/test_markup_sites.py:267` (`pin toast T …` arm → expects the "Pin project" toast)

So adding `Key("T", "T", "templates", …)` either:
